-----------------------------------------------
REPLACE  -REPLACR Control
> replace file
  _rf  FILEPATH  pattern
    ex.
     rf ~/solidjs-dnd-resize/file AAAA BBBB  
        => ~/solidjs-dnd-resize/file_

> replace directory
  _rd  [N]  pattern
    ex.
     rd 1   AAAA BBBB
  _rd  DIRPATH  pattern
    ex.
     rd ~/solidjs-dnd-resize  AAAA BBBB
        => ~/solidjs-dnd-resize_

>  _rs       replace current dir save
>  _rd [N]   replace dir stack delete
>  _rp       replace dir stack print
>  _re       replace dir stack edit
>  _rr       replace dir stack reset
>  _rh       replace help
>  _ra       replace alias

